        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PMC: Net Zero places you in the shoes of an elite soldier in charge of a private military company. Undertake dangerous missions with your team, all in the name of profit. Manage which missions you take on, balancing risk and reward to avoid going bankrupt and losing it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your team in various missions in this lightweight, minimalistic, retro-inspired first-person shooter. Choose the missions you wish to complete, balancing risk and reward. Avoid bankruptcy by completing missions and objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which missions to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team and your own personal loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various weapons to complete your missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your squad with a basic move/follow, one-button command system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Intel during missions to unlock bonus missions and characters/weapon loadouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid bankruptcy by completing missions and deciding which team members to take into missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a 'No GMP' mode (No Gameover state mode) for those wanting a more laid-back experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scope</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PMC: Net Zero:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight, efficient first-person retro-inspired shooter with minimalistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow military arcade shooter focusing on quick, light, challenging missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made using the Godot Engine.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PMC: Net Zero places you in the shoes of an elite soldier in charge of a private military company. Undertake dangerous missions with your team, all in the name of profit. Manage which missions you take on, balancing risk and reward to avoid going bankrupt and losing it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your team in various missions in this lightweight, minimalistic, retro-inspired first-person shooter. Choose the missions you wish to complete, balancing risk and reward. Avoid bankruptcy by completing missions and objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which missions to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team and your own personal loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various weapons to complete your missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your squad with a basic move/follow, one-button command system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Intel during missions to unlock bonus missions and characters/weapon loadouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid bankruptcy by completing missions and deciding which team members to take into missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a 'No GMP' mode (No Gameover state mode) for those wanting a more laid-back experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scope</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PMC: Net Zero:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight, efficient first-person retro-inspired shooter with minimalistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow military arcade shooter focusing on quick, light, challenging missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made using the Godot Engine.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "PMC: Net Zero places you in the shoes of an elite soldier in charge of a private military company. Manage which missions to take on in this first person, millitary, retro inspired, action shooter. All in the name of profit.",
